# Kenya Institutional Operating System (IOS) Example

## Overview

This example demonstrates how the Legibility Office Institutional Operating System (IOS) can be applied to Kenya's governance ecosystem.

It is an illustrative reference model intended to show how governance capability, procurement, Digital Public Infrastructure (DPI), public finance, institutional coordination, and AI governance interact to build long-term national capability.

---

# National Context

Country: Republic of Kenya

Population: ~57 million

Government System: Presidential Republic

Administrative Structure

- National Government
- 47 County Governments

